      "label": "sdc02_0000_headteacher_01",
      "hash64": "93CFB7D06897C4A1",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳好，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]同學，\\n我是克拉韋爾。\\r\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳現在方便說話嗎？[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
